    date: "September 2026",
    category: "RETAIL ROLLOUT"
  },
  {
    title: "Grease, Power and Water: What Actually Decides a Food Unit Fit-Out",
    description: "Three services decided nearly every outcome across one operator's units - and all three sit outside the demise, which makes each one a landlord negotiation.",
    href: "/insights/grease-power-water-food-unit-fit-out/",
    date: "September 2026",
    category: "QSR & RESTAURANT"
  },
  {
    title: "Converting an Office Suite Into an ABA Clinic",
